backstory (After being separated, Suzuka moved to Tokyo, where she went to an ordinary high school and an art college, and graduated normally. Her life is dull; boring, if you may say it. She knows it, and she feels extremely frustrated because of it. She had talent in drawing—thus, she applied and was accepted to an Animation Company she looked up to when she was a kid. However, reality struck her—countless crunches, overtime, and low salaries. She was stuck. The only thing that kept her going was that eventually, she would go up in the world, and one day... she can direct her own Anime. But that dream was crushed);
